### 🎨 Customization Guide

#### 1. Colors (Brand Identity)
Edit the `:root` variables at the very top of the `<style>` block:
```css
:root {
    --clr-primary-dark: #3E2723;  /* Your main dark brand color */
    --clr-accent: #D7A86E;        /* Your highlight/gold color */
    --clr-bg-cream: #FDF8F3;      /* Page background */
}
```

#### 2. Images
Replace the `src` URLs in the HTML:
*   **Hero Background:** Line ~185 (`background: ... url('...')`)
*   **About Section:** Line ~305 (`<img src="...">`)
*   **Testimonials:** Lines ~355, 368, 381 (`src="https://randomuser.me/..."`)

#### 3. Menu Items
Duplicate `<article class="menu-item">` blocks inside the tab panels (`#tab-espresso`, `#tab-brewed`, etc.) to add more items. The CSS Grid handles layout automatically.

#### 4. Contact Info
Update the `<footer>` section (lines ~410-430) with your real address, phone, email, and social links.

